    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr Ayesha Mian, chair of the department of psychiatry and dean of students at Aga Khan University, is one of just 40 senior academics from around the world to be selected for the prestigious Executive Leadership in Academic Medicine ( ELAM ) programme for women.",
